  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 7002.201 “Pending criminal matter” means a case which has not been adjudicated. The term does not include an appeal, or a case in which the prosecutorial authority has decided not to bring charges.\n\nSource. #13957, INTERIM, eff 5-7-24, EXPIRES: 11-3-24; ss by #14090, eff 10-1-24",
